{"speciesId":372,"names":{"fr":"Drackhaus","es":"Shelgon","en":"Shelgon","ja":"コモルー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Inside SHELGON’s armor-like shell, cells are in the midst of transformation to create an entirely new body. This POKéMON’s shell is extremely heavy, making its movements sluggish."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Covering SHELGON’s body are outgrowths much like bones. The shell is very hard and bounces off enemy attacks. When awaiting evolution, this POKéMON hides away in a cavern."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It hardly eats while it awaits evolution. It becomes hardier by enduring hunger. Its shell peels off the instant it begins to evolve."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its armored body makes all attacks bounce off. The armor is too tough, however, making it heavy and somewhat sluggish."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its armored body makes all attacks bounce off. The armor is too tough, however, making it heavy and somewhat sluggish."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It surrounds its body in an iron-hard shell to accumulate enough power to evolve."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It surrounds its body in an iron-hard shell to accumulate enough power to evolve."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses cellules ont commencé à changer dans sa robuste coquille. Il la perd en évoluant."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses cellules ont commencé à changer dans sa robuste coquille. Il la perd en évoluant."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses cellules ont commencé à changer dans sa robuste coquille. Il la perd en évoluant."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Las células han empezado a cambiar dentro de su dura concha, que se separa cuando evoluciona."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"硬い 殻の 中では 細胞が 変化を はじめている。進化する 瞬間に 殻が はがれ落ちる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps renforcé repousse toutes les attaques. Cependant, le poids important de cette armure empêche Drackhaus de se déplacer librement."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La robusta capa que lo rodea repele los ataques. Aunque es una buena protección, lo hace lento y pesado."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its armored body makes all attacks bounce off. The armor is too tough, however, making it heavy and somewhat sluggish."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"あらゆる 攻撃を 跳ね返す。 丈夫すぎて 体が 重いため 少し 動きが 鈍い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"À l’intérieur de la carapace blindée de Drackhaus, ses cellules sont en pleine transformation pour créer un nouveau corps. La carapace de ce Pokémon est très lourde, ce qui rend ses mouvements très lents."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dentro de la capa acorazada de Shelgon, las células están en pleno proceso de creación de un cuerpo nuevo. El peso de la coraza le hace tener unos movimientos lentos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Inside Shelgon’s armor-like shell, cells are in the midst of transformation to create an entirely new body. This Pokémon’s shell is extremely heavy, making its movements sluggish."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"硬い カラの 内部は 細胞が 変化して 新しい 体を つくっている 最中。 カラが とても 重いので 動きは 鈍いぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Des excroissances osseuses recouvrent le corps de Drackhaus. Cette carapace est extrêmement dure et le protège des attaques ennemies. En attendant son évolution, ce Pokémon reste caché dans une caverne."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Shelgon está recubierto por una especie de capa ósea: una coraza muy dura que hace rebotar los ataques enemigos. Este Pokémon se esconde en las cavernas para evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Covering Shelgon’s body are outgrowths much like bones. The shell is very hard and bounces off enemy attacks. When awaiting evolution, this Pokémon hides away in a cavern."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体を 覆っているのは ホネのような もの。 とても 硬く 敵の 攻撃を 跳ね返す。 洞穴で 身を 潜め 進化を 待っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"À l’intérieur de sa carapace, ses cellules subissent un bouleversement cataclysmique. Il se prépare ainsi à son évolution."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"En el interior de su coraza, las células se transforman a una velocidad vertiginosa para preparar su evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The cells within its shell transform with explosive speed, preparing it for evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"殻の 中では 爆発的な スピードで 細胞が 変化し 進化の 準備を しているぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il se cache sans bouger au fond de sa grotte, sans eau ni nourriture. Les raisons de sa survie sont, à franchement parler, un véritable mystère."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Permanece quieto en el fondo de las grutas sin probar bocado ni beber ningún líquido. Resulta sorprendente que pueda sobrevivir así."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They lurk deep within caves—motionless, neither eating nor drinking. Why they don’t die is not known."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"洞穴の 奥に じっと 潜み 何も 喰わず 何も 飲まない。 なぜ 死なないのかは 不明だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"À l’intérieur de sa carapace, dont la composition s’apparente à celle des os, son corps subit une véritable révolution cellulaire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Las células de su cuerpo se transforman a una velocidad vertiginosa. Su dura coraza está formada por una especie de tejido óseo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The cells within its body are changing at a bewildering pace. Its hard shell is made from the same substance as bone."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"体内の 細胞が 目まぐるしく 変化している 最中。 硬い カラは ホネと 同じ 成分だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il habite au fond des grottes et, bien à l’abri au creux de sa solide carapace, il rêve du jour où il pourra enfin s’envoler dans les cieux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Vive en el fondo de las grutas. Mientras se recluye en su dura concha, sueña con el día en el que pueda surcar el cielo volando."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Shelgon lives deep within caves. It stays shut up in its hard shell, dreaming of the day it will be able to fly."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"洞窟の 奥深くに 棲む。 硬い カラの 中に 閉じこもり 空を 飛ぶ 日を 夢見ている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon emmagasine l’énergie nécessaire à son évolution sous sa carapace dont la composition est identique à celles des os."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Lo recubre una dura coraza de tejido óseo. En el interior, acumula energía de cara a la evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon has covered its body in a hard shell that has the same composition as bone. Shelgon stores energy for evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"骨と 同じ 成分で できた 硬い 殻で 体を 包む。 進化の エネルギーを 蓄える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se prive de nourriture, résistant à la faim. On dit que son évolution commence lorsque ses réserves d’énergie sont épuisées."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Aguanta el hambre sin comer nada. Al parecer, inicia el proceso evolutivo cuando se agota toda la energía que tenía acumulada."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Shelgon ignores its hunger entirely, never eating any food. Apparently, Shelgon will evolve once all its energy stores are used up."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"エサを 食べず 空腹に 耐える。 溜めた エネルギーを 使い切ると 進化が 始まるらしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":372,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",17],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",17],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",17],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",16],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",16],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",16],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",16],[12,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",17],[13,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",17],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",16],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[20,"level-up",15],[23,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[5,"level-up",78],[6,"level-up",78],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",78],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",61]